<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first division after</p>
<p>Friday's matches:</p>
<p>3 goals - Bruni Rodriguez (Metz)</p>
<p>2 - Florian Maurice (Paris St Germain), Lionel Rouxel (Guingamp),</p>
<p>Laurent Blanc (Marseille), Lilian Laslandes (Bordeaux), Didier</p>
<p>Martel (Chateauroux), Tony Vairelles (Lens), David Zitelli</p>
<p>(Strasbourg)</p>
</text>
